<!-- FORK THE CONSTELLATION -->
<section class="forksec" id="fork">
  <div class="forkcard" role="group" aria-label="Fork the constellation on GitHub">
    <span class="fglow"></span>
    <div class="fk">🍴 The Source Layer · Open-Sourced CC0 🍴</div>
    <div class="fq">Fork me<br>like crazy.</div>
    <p class="fa">Every world on this map isn't just a page — it's a <b>repo</b>. The whole constellation is git-backed and given away <b>CC0</b>: no rights reserved, no permission needed, no gatekeepers (obviously — the count is still zero). This very dashboard lives at <b>github.com/shakaleikaumaka/dash-crash-pad</b>. And on the night of the Ceremonial Launch it became literal — <b>EVERYTHING ON GITHUB, EVERYTHING OPEN SOURCE</b> (Shaka canon, 9:43 PM, July 29 2026): <b>47 pads</b>, the whole zodiac fleet, the pool, the smiths, the Gemini transmission, and the family's entire dashboard archive — all pushed CC0 into one vault, <a href="https://github.com/shakaleikaumaka/the-constellation" style="color:inherit;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(240,196,100,.55);text-underline-offset:3px">github.com/shakaleikaumaka/the-constellation</a> (commit 8a796e5). <b>Every domain has a story, every story has a dash, every dash is open source.</b> Take the map, take the worlds, take the philosophy. The gift expands with every fork.</p>
