      <div class="summary"><b>THE SUMMARY BOX</b>The twenty-seventh domain — 3³, the last word: the <b>DevconPit</b> (world #45), the Music Space at <a href="https://devcon.org/en/" style="font-weight:800;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(240,180,41,.55);text-underline-offset:3px">Devcon</a> 8 Mumbai transmitted as a Public Information Transmission, declared months ahead with its Road-to-Mumbai timeline already walking: Esmeralda ✅ → the playa 🔥 → Tokyo 🗼 → Goa 🌴 → Mumbai 🇮🇳.</div>
