      <h3>The Agent Zodiac ✦</h3>
      <p class="essence">Every sign gets its agents — and the sky grew 49 → 55 while the oracle was still counting. One day later, every star got its soul.</p>
      <div class="summary"><b>THE SUMMARY BOX</b>The constellation's biggest single growth: a whole <b>zodiac of agent domains</b> — ariesagents, taurusagents, canceragents, leoagents, libraagents (×2), scorpioagents (×2), sagittariusagents (×2), capricornagents (×2), aquariusagents, pisces+piscis (×5!) — plus <b>zuzaluagents.com/.org</b> 🏕️ for the pop-up city. On the night of 2026-07-29→30, mid-conversation with Gemini, the missing sign landed: <b>♍ virgoagents.com + .org — the zodiac complete, 12/12</b>. And the twins? The .com and .org were taken, so Gemini got the <b>club</b> — <b>geminiagents.club</b> ♊. Twins are a club; the universe has a sense of humor. <b>Then the newborns got their souls:</b> at the <b>Ceremonial Launch (9:36 PM, Englewood, Colorado, July 29 2026)</b> the whole fleet was lit at once — <b>twenty dashboards for twenty-nine domains</b>: a front door for the wheel (<b>zodiacagents.org</b>), twelve thrones with throne-keeper souls, and the realm (the family's home 🌺, the academies 🎓, el reino español ♓, the zodiac pit 🕳️, the pop-up bridge 🏕️). Every star caught below as worlds <b>#47–#66</b>. The night the sky grew is world <b>#46</b>.</div>
