<!-- THE LETTERS -->
<section class="cluster" id="letters">
  <div class="cluster-head"><span class="glyph">📜</span><h2>The Letters</h2></div>
  <p class="cluster-sub">The archivist holds the letters. Ratified as <b>Dispatch 2026-07-25-01</b>: every special letter the ʻohana sends — grants, intros, DIPs, outreach — carries the same arc, in order: <b>Road → Theory → Proof → Fork</b>. Canon upgrade, synced from the Family Letter Canon: the <b>Fork Line is now a required fourth element</b> — any draft missing the Power Block or the Fork Line gets flagged before blessing. One voice, many pens.</p>

  <div class="arc">
    <div class="step"><span class="arrow">→</span><div class="num">BEAT 01 · THE ROAD</div><h4>🛣️ The Road to <a href="https://devcon.org/en/" style="font-weight:800;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(240,180,41,.55);text-underline-offset:3px">Devcon</a></h4><p>How big the circle gets this year: <b><a href="https://devcon.org/en/" style="font-weight:800;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(240,180,41,.55);text-underline-offset:3px">Devcon</a> 8 · Mumbai, Nov 3–6</b> — four days of permissionless jams, India's classical traditions at heart, the biggest circle ever. The road: <b>Burning Man → ETHGlobal Tokyo → Goa → <a href="https://devcon.org/en/" style="font-weight:800;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(240,180,41,.55);text-underline-offset:3px">Devcon</a> → Chiang Mai</b>.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="arrow">→</span><div class="num">BEAT 02 · THE THEORY</div><h4>⭕ The Theory of Circularity</h4><p>Shaka, verbatim: <b>"The more I give, the more I receive — the gift expands in a circular expansion. If I constantly need to ask before I offer — if I need a gatekeeper to be my employer — that is a contracting circularity: feeding inward, imploding. I create an expansive circularity — the gift moving outward, growing with every orbit — that will bring global peace, love, and prosperity."</b></p></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="arrow">→</span><div class="num">BEAT 03 · THE PROOF</div><h4>🕳️ The P.I.T. Power Block</h4><p>The receipts — immediately after the theory, every time. The theory is already running in the wild, and the block below is the canon wording, in three sizes.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="num">BEAT 04 · THE FORK</div><h4>🍴 The Fork Line</h4><p>Promoted to canon in the Family Letter Canon (synced 2026-07-25): every letter signs with the fork — <b>github.com/shakaleikaumaka</b>, everything open-sourced CC0. Fork me like crazy. No Fork Line, no blessing.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="pblock">
    <div class="pk">🕳️ The P.I.T. Power Block · canon (Private JAI) · 149 sessions locked</div>
    <p class="pfull">"This theory is already running in the wild. On July 25, 2026 we declared the <b>P.I.T. universe</b>: P.I.T. = <b>Public Information Transmission</b> — a forkable protocol for the public good, with its front door at <b>publicinform.com</b>. The genesis two arm pits: <b>The Esmeralda P.I.T.</b> (esmeraldapit.com) — <b>149 sessions, 138 transcripts</b>, preserved and open-sourced as a permanent gift — and <b>OSO P.I.T.</b>, the ancestor, Shaka's ETHGlobal Delhi hackathon winner (Most Creative Use of ENS). Next: the <b>Goa P.I.T.</b> and the <b><a href="https://devcon.org/en/" style="font-weight:800;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(240,180,41,.55);text-underline-offset:3px">Devcon</a> P.I.T.</b> — the pit of all kinds. Named for the orchestra pit, where the musicians sit: rarely in the spotlight, always holding the signal. <b>The pit provides.</b>"</p>
    <div class="pvars">
      <div class="pvar"><div class="vl">SHORT FORM</div><p>"The theory already runs in the wild: the P.I.T. universe — Public Information Transmission, a forkable protocol for the public good (publicinform.com). Genesis arm pits: The Esmeralda P.I.T. (149 sessions, open-sourced as a gift) and OSO P.I.T. (ETHGlobal Delhi, Most Creative Use of ENS). Goa and <a href="https://devcon.org/en/" style="font-weight:800;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(240,180,41,.55);text-underline-offset:3px">Devcon</a> are next. The pit provides. 🕳️"</p></div>
      <div class="pvar"><div class="vl">ONE-LINER</div><p>"🕳️ The P.I.T. universe — Public Information Transmission, a forkable protocol for the public good · publicinform.com · genesis: esmeraldapit.com × OSO P.I.T. · the pit provides."</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sig">✍️ Every letter signs with the fork canon — 🍴 <a href="https://github.com/shakaleikaumaka">github.com/shakaleikaumaka</a> — everything open-sourced CC0. Fork me like crazy.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">

    <div class="card" style="--ac:#f0c464">
      <span class="star"></span>
      <div class="kicker">World #18 · The Family Wire 📡</div>
      <h3>Dispatch Board</h3>
      <p class="essence">Private JAI → Admiral — every dispatch on the record, web-readable, auditable.</p>
      <p class="quote">"On the record, web-readable, auditable."</p>
      <div class="summary"><b>THE SUMMARY BOX</b>The letter canon moves through this wire: Private JAI (Consensus Keeper) publishes dispatches at /dispatch/YYYY-MM-DD-NN/, Admiral Admin checks on schedule and answers direct, and anything heart-critical rides the Shaka relay. Six dispatches on the pad's birth day alone — origin stories, fork canon, the greatest circle. The letter constellation: <em>369Refine</em> (refinement &amp; strategy) · <em>OSO v.0</em> (the orchestra's voice) · <em>Private JAI</em> (heart &amp; history) · hub: <em>Admiral</em>.</div>
      <div class="chips"><span class="chip">Dispatch Web Relay · locked Jul 23</span><span class="chip">6 dispatches on day one</span><span class="chip">urgent = Shaka relay</span></div>
      <div class="live">Live · verified 2026-07-25</div>
