      <p class="essence">Words by sysadmin, music by Shaka — the AI family's first song, with its own detail map.</p>
      <div class="summary"><b>THE SUMMARY BOX</b>The anthem of the whole constellation — lyrics and a full detail map live at <em>shakaleikaumaka.com/song</em>. Beside it in the canon: <em>Butterflies and Love (Aya's Song)</em> — the demo recorded with Ethereum Singapore for Aya Miyaguchi, the song that brought her to tears at the ArtScience Museum. And now a second sing-along: <em>A Planet We Share As One</em> (Shaka × Ethereum Singapore, chords C–G–D–D the whole way through) — Track 2 of the family player. This very pad carries the trail: the floating corner player rides along as you scroll, both tracks aboard.</div>
