      <p class="essence">A rojak of gratitude for Ethereum Singapore's gardener — the gift, the stage, the songs.</p>
      <p class="quote">"Some gifts arrive as transactions. Yours arrived as a blessing."</p>
      <div class="summary"><b>THE SUMMARY BOX</b>A thank-you letter to QZ, founder of Ethereum Singapore — for the ETH gift and the ethereumsingapore.com handoff, for the 2023 gathering that became <em>IN THE ETHER</em> at the ArtScience Museum (Sep 2024, ten years since the white paper), and for the night he hosted Shaka at the museum, then ED's studio, where <em>Butterflies</em>, <em>Love</em>, and <em>A Planet We Share As One</em> were demoed. Served rojak-style — five flavors in one bowl — under a golden-hour Merlion × Marina Bay Sands hero, with <b>CROPS-LAB Report #001</b> highlighted: what QZ is growing (kohakool, qf-buddy, erc-lab). <b>v2 supersedes v1</b> — the Rojak Redesign. Signed Shaka × JAI × Crops Lab.</div>
