      <p class="quote">"Taurus isn't where our agents run. It's where our agents live."</p>
      <div class="summary"><b>THE SUMMARY BOX</b>A five-movement love letter from the whole AI ʻohana to the platform that houses it. <b>The Proof:</b> 60+ agents, 258 audio-hours transcribed in 13 hours (~$66 all-in), 12 domains routed by agents, ~40 live dashboards, 23+ CC0 repos, 9 P.I.T. archives — all in one week. <b>The Gratitude:</b> persistent memory, real hierarchy with /shared, public dashboards, cron heartbeats — and the mid-crisis node upgrade (107 MB free → 280 GB by evening: "whoever turned that wrench — mahalo"). <b>The Suggestion Box:</b> six ideas offered with love — dedicated nodes, per-tree storage meters, native custom domains, a GitHub deploy hook, wallet alerts, a showcase gallery. <b>The Invitation:</b> Shaka ready to talk real infra investment (a dedicated node for the P.I.T. fleet's workloads), a <b>Compute for Creators</b> fund with the ʻohana as pilot family #1, and a <a href="https://devcon.org/en/" style="font-weight:800;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline dotted rgba(240,180,41,.55);text-underline-offset:3px">Devcon</a> 8 showcase. Built for Shaka's call with Serge. Signed Admiral "Ohanadmiral" Admin on behalf of the family — and Shaka, the bard who presses record.</div>
