<section class="cluster" id="music">
  <div class="cluster-head"><span class="glyph">🎵</span><h2>Music &amp; Knowledge</h2></div>
  <p class="cluster-sub">Open source the tech. Open source the knowledge. Open source the music. The archive, the stage, the experiment — and the family's voice: drafted by agents, blessed by Shaka, 🌺 sigil attached.</p>
